WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.100
When an AI denies a claim, someone asks why.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.850
The vendor sends a PDF, and a promise.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.050
EPI sends the decision itself: sealed, signed, and readable.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.500
What the model saw. What it decided. Which rule it applied. Who signed off.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Their reviewer checks it in a browser. No install. No account.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:31.450
And if someone edits the record, and re-seals it with the vendor's own key...

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.800
the signature still verifies.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.900
Their copy does not.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.450
A signature protects the file. The witness protects the customer.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.100
One workflow. Thirty days. Four and a half thousand euros.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.700
EPI. Hand them a file they can check.
